Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Stained Glass OS -- default window metrics.
;
; A taller, Windows-10-proportioned title bar. Values are negative twips
; (-15 per pixel at 96 DPI), which is how Windows stores them and what Wine
; reads: -450 is 30 pixels.
;
; The caption buttons stay square (CaptionWidth = CaptionHeight). Wine reserves
; room for the title text by caption height per button, so buttons wider than
; tall would let a long title run underneath them.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Control Panel\Desktop\WindowMetrics]
"CaptionHeight"="-450"
"CaptionWidth"="-450"
